      "q_num": 1,
      "question": "If x + 1/x = 5, find x^2 + 1/x^2.",
      "options": {
        "a": "23",
        "b": "25",
        "c": "27",
        "d": "21"
      },
      "answer": "a",
      "solution": "1. Square both sides of (x + 1/x) = 5:\n(x + 1/x)^2 = 25\n2. x^2 + 2 + 1/x^2 = 25\n3. x^2 + 1/x^2 = 25 - 2 = 23."
    }
  ]
}
